        "stdout": "n,text,sop,alt,label_state\n8,\"my volunteering shifts keep getting mixed up with work stuff, so please add a calendar called Volunteering just for them\",\"@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"my\"\" dependent=\"\"volunteering\"\" head=\"\"shifts\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"\"keep\"\" subject=$n1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"\"getting\"\" verb=\"\"mixed\"\" modifier=\"\"up\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"with\"\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"work\"\" head=\"\"stuff\"\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"\"so\"\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"\"please\"\" verb=\"\"add\"\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"called\"\" modifier=\"\"just\"\" complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Volunteering\"\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"\"them\"\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c4\",\"@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"my\"\" dependent=\"\"volunteering\"\" head=\"\"shifts\"\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"\"keep\"\" subject=$n1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"getting\"\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"mixed\"\" modifier=\"\"up\"\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"\"with\"\" from=$c3 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"work\"\" head=\"\"stuff\"\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"\"so\"\" conjunct=$c3 conjunct=$c4\n@c4 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"\"please\"\" verb=\"\"add\"\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"\"a\"\" head=\"\"calendar\"\"\n@c5 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"\"called\"\" modifier=\"\"just\"\" complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"\"Volunteering\"\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"\"for\"\" from=$c5 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"\"them\"\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c3\n@r5 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c5\",\n9,\"ok so before we plan the trip, make me a Travel calendar and then put a Packing reminder on it Friday\",\"@c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discou---\n2449 meetings-07-advanced.p01.csv\n",
