      "outputText": "### 0 n=8\nT: my volunteering shifts keep getting mixed up with work stuff, so please add a calendar called Volunteering just for them\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" dependent=\"volunteering\" head=\"shifts\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"keep\" subject=$n1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"getting\" verb=\"mixed\" modifier=\"up\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"work\" head=\"stuff\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"so\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"please\" verb=\"add\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"calendar\"\n@c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"called\" modifier=\"just\" complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Volunteering\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"them\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$c4\n\n### 1 n=9\nT: ok so before we plan the trip, make me a Travel calendar and then put a Packing reminder on it Friday\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"ok\" modifier=\"so\" verb=\"make\" complement=$n3 complement=$n4\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"before\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"we\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"plan\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"trip\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"me\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"Travel\" head=\"calendar\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"put\" complement=$n5 complement=$n7\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"Packing\" head=\"reminder\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@n7 syntax.nominal head=\"Friday\"\n\n### 2 n=18\nT: new calendar named Study, colour it grey\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"new\" head=\"calendar\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"named\" complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Study\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"colour\" complement=$n3 complement=$n4\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"grey\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c3 conjunct=$c2\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$c1\n\n### 3 n=20\nT: since Family is already blue, can you create a Kids calendar in yellow so I can tell them apart?\nS: @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"since\" from=$c2 to=$c1\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Family\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" modifier=\"already\" modifier=\"blue\" subject=$n1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"create\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"Kids\" head=\"calendar\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"yellow\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"tell\" modifier=\"apart\" subject=$n5 complement=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"them\"\n\n### 4 n=22\nT: I keep missing bin days, so let's have a Chores calendar, bright magenta so it stands out\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"keep\" subject=$n1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"missing\" complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"bin\" head=\"days\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"so\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c3\n@c3 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"let\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"'s\"\n@c4 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"have\" complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"Chores\" head=\"calendar\"\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"bright\" head=\"magenta\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c4 to=$c5\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@c5 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"stands\" modifier=\"out\" subject=$n6\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c3 to=$c4\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$n4 to=$n5\n\n### 5 n=26\nT: new calendar in sky blue please\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"new\" head=\"calendar\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"sky\" head=\"blue\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment discourse=\"please\" complement=$n1\n\n### 6 n=27\nT: make a calendar for Podcast, something warm-coloured\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"make\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"calendar\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Podcast\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"something\" dependent=\"warm\" dependent=\"coloured\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n3\n\n### 7 n=28\nT: add a Reading calendar, any colour that isn't used yet\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"add\" complement=$k1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"Reading\" head=\"calendar\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"any\" head=\"colour\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"that\" from=$n2 to=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"is\" negation=\"n't\" verb=\"used\" modifier=\"yet\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$n1 conjunct=$n2\n\n### 8 n=29\nT: one more calendar, mint colour\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"one\" dependent=\"more\" head=\"calendar\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"mint\" head=\"colour\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n\n### 9 n=33\nT: call the Family calendar Home from now on\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"call\" modifier=\"on\" complement=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Family\" head=\"calendar\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Home\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"now\"\n\n### 10 n=38\nT: if nobody