ominal head=\"I\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"freelance\" modifier=\"too\" subject=$n3\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Agency\" head=\"work\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$n1 to=$n2\n\n### 13 n=47\nT: rename that one Hobbies\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"rename\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"that\" dependent=\"one\" head=\"Hobbies\"\n\n### 14 n=51\nT: I'd like Work shown in purple\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"'d\" verb=\"like\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Work\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"shown\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$c2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"purple\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n2\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$c2\n\n### 15 n=57\nT: ok so paint the Gym calendar black and move yoga onto it\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"ok\" verb=\"paint\" modifier=\"black\" complement=$n1\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"so\" conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Gym\" head=\"calendar\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"move\" complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"yoga\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"onto\" from=$c2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n\nTOTALCHARS 8850\n",
