    "state": {
      "status": "completed",
      "output": {
        "stdout": "### 16 n=58\nT: my daughter picked the colours: she wants Family in violet. Can you do that?\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"daughter\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"picked\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"colours\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"she\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"wants\" subject=$n3 complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"Family\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$n4 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"violet\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"Can\" verb=\"do\" subject=$n6 complement=$n7\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@n7 syntax.nominal head=\"that\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n\n### 17 n=59\nT: the red on the Work calendar feels alarming - could we go with a calm navy?\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"red\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Work\" head=\"calendar\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"feels\" modifier=\"alarming\" subject=$n1\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"could\" verb=\"go\" subject=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"we\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$c2 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"calm\" head=\"navy\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c1\n\n### 18 n=60\nT: Family a bit darker\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"Family\" modifier=\"darker\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"bit\"\n\n### 19 n=62\nT: colour it gold\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"colour\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"gold\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1 complement=$n2 complement=$n3\n\n### 20 n=63\nT: gym calendar: something brighter\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"gym\" head=\"calendar\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"something\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"brighter\" complement=$n2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=fragment complement=$n1\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c2 conjunct=$c1\n\n### 21 n=66\nT: please get rid of the Work calendar\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"please\" auxiliary=\"get\" verb=\"rid\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Work\" head=\"calendar\"\n\n### 22 n=68\nT: I want the Gym calendar gone\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"want\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Gym\" head=\"calendar\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"gone\" subject=$n2\n@r1 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n### 23 n=72\nT: I cancelled my membership, so the Gym calendar can go\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"cancelled\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"membership\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Gym\" head=\"calendar\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"go\" subject=$n3\n\n### 24 n=75\nT: rename Work to Office and then delete Gym altogether\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"rename\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Work\"\n@r1 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Office\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative modifier=\"then\" verb=\"delete\" modifier=\"altogether\" complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"Gym\"\n\n### 25 n=77\nT: honestly I never look at Travel anymore; would you mind deleting that calendar?\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"honestly\" negation=\"never\" verb=\"look\" modifier=\"anymore\" subject=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"Travel\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=inter