        "stdout": "### 75 n=180\nT: I want Oak room renamed to Oak hall\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"want\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Oak\" head=\"room\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"renamed\" subject=$n2\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Oak\" head=\"hall\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n### 76 n=182\nT: facilities renamed all the rooms after rivers, so the Board room is now Danube\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"facilities\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"renamed\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"all\" dependent=\"the\" head=\"rooms\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"after\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"rivers\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Board\" head=\"room\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" modifier=\"now\" subject=$n4 complement=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"Danube\"\n\n### 77 n=185\nT: hmm, Focus pod sounds odd to clients - let's go with Think tank instead\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"hmm\" verb=\"let\" complement=$n3\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Focus\" head=\"pod\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"sounds\" modifier=\"odd\" subject=$n1\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c2 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"clients\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"'s\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"go\" modifier=\"instead\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$c3 to=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Think\" head=\"tank\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n@r4 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c3\n\n### 78 n=186\nT: ok so the sign outside now says Cedar 2, please update the cedar room to match\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative discourse=\"ok\" modifier=\"so\" modifier=\"outside\" modifier=\"now\" verb=\"says\" subject=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=