n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"marketing\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"so\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Focus\" head=\"pod\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"is\" modifier=\"up\" modifier=\"now\" subject=$n4\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c2 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"6th\" head=\"floor\"\n\n### 92 n=223\nT: move the Cedar room to building A and rename it Cedar A\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"move\" complement=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Cedar\" head=\"room\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"building\" head=\"A\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"rename\" complement=$n3 complement=$n4\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Cedar\" head=\"A\"\n\n### 93 n=224\nT: guests can't find the focus pod; would you note that it's behind reception, past the coffee machine?\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"guests\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"ca\" negation=\"n't\" verb=\"find\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"focus\" head=\"pod\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"would\" verb=\"note\" subject=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"that\" from=$c2 to=$c3\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"'s\" subject=$n4\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"behind\" from=$c3 to=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"reception\"\n@r3 syntax.relation marker=\"past\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"coffee\" head=\"machine\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n\n### 94 n=225\nT: if the Oak room really is in the basement now, please update where it is\nS: @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"if\" from=$c2 to=$c1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Oak\" head=\"room\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"really\" verb=\"is\" modifier=\"now\" subject=$n1\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"in\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"basement\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"please\" verb=\"update\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"where\" verb=\"is\" subject=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c3\n\n### 95 n=226\nT: ok so after the office move the Board room is at 40 King Street, 2nd floor - can you fix that?\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative discourse=\"ok\" modifier=\"so\" verb=\"is\" subject=$n2\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"after\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"office\" head=\"move\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Board\" head=\"room\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"40\" dependent=\"King\" head=\"Street\"\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"2nd\" head=\"floor\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"fix\" subject=$n5 complement=$n6\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"that\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$n3 to=$n4\n\n### 96 n=227\nT: this room moved upstairs\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"this\" head=\"room\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"moved\" modifier=\"upstairs\" subject=$n1\n\n### 97 n=233\nT: Board room moved to floor 9\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Board\" head=\"room\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"moved\" subject=$n1\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"to\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"floor\"\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"9\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$n2 to=$n3\n\n### 98 n=236\nT: please get rid of the board room\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative discourse=\"please\" auxiliary=\"get\" verb=\"rid\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"of\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"board\" head=\"room\"\n\n### 99 n=238\nT: I want the Focus pod removed as a room\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"want\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Focus\" head=\"pod\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"removed\" subject=$n2\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$c2 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"room\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n### 100 n=243\nT: if no one has the Library booked, you can delete that room\nS: @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"if\" from=$c3 to=$c1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"no\" head=\"one\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"has\" subject=$n1\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"Library\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"booked\" subject=$n2\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"delete\" subject=$n3 complement=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"that\" head=\"room\"\n@r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n\n### 101 n=244\nT: the building closed the old Annex for good; would you mind removing it from the rooms?\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"building\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"closed\" subject=$n1 complement=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"old\" head=\"Annex\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal head=\"good\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"would\" verb=\"mind\" subject=$n4\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@c3 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"removing\" complement=$n5\n@n5 syntax.nominal head=\"it\"\n@r2 syntax.relation marker=\"from\" from=$c3 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"rooms\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n@r3 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c3\n\nRANGE 75 102 CHARS 12941\n",
