clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"would\" verb=\"be\" modifier=\"perfect\" subject=$n6\n@r5 syntax.relation from=$c2 to=$c1\n\n### 121 n=291\nT: meeting with Mihai, Cedar room\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"meeting\" complement=$n2\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Mihai\"\n@n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"Cedar\" head=\"room\"\n\n### 122 n=296\nT: Ana and I are planning the holiday party; can you create a Party planning meeting with her on the Work calendar for next Monday at 4?\nS: @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"Ana\"\n@k1 syntax.coordination conjunction=\"and\" conjunct=$n1 conjunct=$n2\n@n2 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n@c1 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"are\" verb=\"planning\" subject=$k1 complement=$n3\n@n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"holiday\" head=\"party\"\n@c2 syntax.clause form=interrogative auxiliary=\"can\" verb=\"create\" subject=$n4 complement=$n5\n@n4 syntax.nominal head=\"you\"\n@n5 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"Party\" dependent=\"planning\" head=\"meeting\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"with\" from=$n5 to=$n6\n@n6 syntax.nominal head=\"her\"\n@r2 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"on\" from=$c2 to=$n7\n@n7 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Work\" head=\"calendar\"\n@r3 syntax.relation attachment=ambiguous marker=\"for\" from=$c2 to=$n8\n@n8 syntax.nominal dependent=\"next\" head=\"Monday\"\n@r4 syntax.relation marker=\"at\" from=$n8 to=$n9\n@n9 syntax.nominal head=\"4\"\n@k2 syntax.coordination conjunct=$c1 conjunct=$c2\n\n### 123 n=297\nT: meeting on the Work calendar tomorrow\nS: @c1 syntax.clause form=nonfinite verb=\"meeting\" modifier=\"tomorrow\"\n@r1 syntax.relation marker=\"on\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n@n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"Work\" head=\"calendar\"\n\nRANGE 102 124 CHARS 12955\n",
